<title>HONG KONG: Lippo interim profit down 15.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Lippo interim profit down 15.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   57.0	  vs 67.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    7.0	   vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  201.66 gain vs 200.89 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    246.96	vs 291.59</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,809.12    vs 894.73</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lippo Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 28-31</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Lippo provides financial services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
